cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the Atlas with its revision or access date. Also cite the original paper or outside report when relying on its result; see docs/ATTRIBUTION.md."
title: "Plectis Atlas: OpenAI's mathematics release, read and checked"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cook"
    given-names: "Will"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcook04/plectis-atlas"
url: "https://wcook04.github.io/plectis-atlas/"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - exposition
  - AI-generated mathematics
abstract: >-
  An independent static reader for OpenAI's mathematics release, combining
  source browsing with attributed outside assessments. The Apache-2.0 licence
  here describes original Atlas code and documentation. Imported records,
  fonts and other components retain the terms listed in NOTICE.
references:
